  <item>
    <title>28 《镖人》不出意外的打戏爽了，文戏拉了（串台：扯会闲篇）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a0666666e2c3037789aa9e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a0666666e2c3037789aa9e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>主播：“普通观众日记”胖泡 &nbsp;“扯会闲篇”老刘</span></p><span></span><p><span>春节档《镖人》，不出意外的打戏爽了，不出意外的文戏拉了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们对于武侠电影有很多回忆，我们对于这部电影的编剧有很多吐槽。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">00:05:49</a> 《镖人》的打分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="611">00:10:11</a> 非原著党表示：你们到底为啥啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">00:13:53</a> 编剧团队三王带一菜，你猜谁是那个菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">00:19:25</a> 因为加戏而毁掉的角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1252">00:20:52</a> 没人发现那么大个拍摄失误吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1379">00:22:59</a> 要不咱们还是说说打戏吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">00:30:10</a> 镖人之后，可能真的就没武侠片能看了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">00:34:32</a> 打戏给得很足，但是我们还不满足</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2206">00:36:46</a> 无奖竞猜镖人最能打的是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2259">00:37:39</a> 知事郎变喜之郎</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2452">00:40:52</a> 裴行俭无效出演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2604">00:43:24</a> 排不明白开会戏，文戏编剧全责</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2818">00:46:58</a> 泡同学又开始暴论：陈丽君适配度不高</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3055">00:50:55</a> 泡同学花痴：李云霄真好看啊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3248">00:54:08</a> 推荐大家有条件可以进电影院去看</span></p>]]></description>
